.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Builder that outputs epub3 files\&.

It creates the metainfo files content\&.opf, nav\&.xhtml, toc\&.ncx, mimetype,
and META-INF/container\&.xml\&. Afterwards, all necessary files are zipped to
an epub file\&.

.fi
.PP
 
